<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`VEHICLE_LINEAR_MOTOR_DIRECTION: number = 18`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer VEHICLE_LINEAR_MOTOR_DIRECTION = 18;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant VEHICLE_LINEAR_MOTOR_DIRECTION has the value 18</p>
  <p>Vector of linear velocity (in meters/second) that the vehicle will try to achieve.</p>
  <p>May conflict with any active <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlTargetOmega" target="_blank">llTargetOmega</a> set in the root prim and prevent vehicle turns. Call <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlTargetOmega" target="_blank">llTargetOmega</a> with a gain of 0 to disable it.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
